East and West both get good reviews!
I still believe in Amazon’s own products; now that we can buy overseas, it is convenient to get things shipped back from abroad and the shipping time is just a few days longer than domestic shipments. I have no doubt about Amazon’s ability to clear customs for us when buying overseas goods, which is much faster than going through a third-party carrier. Therefore, many people are turning to Amazon’s Overseas Shopping service to purchase items online.
I hope that domestic products will be of better quality and lower prices; many things are domestically produced but come back cheaper abroad than in China. I hope to see improvements.
Buying something that has been opened by someone else.
It would be much more reasonable to collect taxes at a rate of over one hundred dollars per three hundred machines when they are currently taxed at six hundred dollars each.
The seal tape on receipt looks out of order; it's almost like it has been opened before. I took some photos right away and sure enough, it broke open easily after being pulled apart. Inside were still damaged pieces of paperboard, and I was worried someone might have returned them, so I quickly gave it a try for my husband since we were nearing our anniversary. To his great relief, it didn't even work, luckily there were no burrs inside the knife head. Otherwise, how would we return something that far?
It is not known whether it will work well or if there might be any problems in the short term. As with previous reviews, items that were shipped when out of stock turned out to be unreliable!
It's okay for East and West, but Amazon’s customer service is really worse than other websites.
After placing an order and realizing it was placed incorrectly, but there is no way to cancel the order, the online customer service always displays an error link that cannot be contacted.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
When you apply for a refund, it’s not until then that you learn that once delivered, food items cannot be returned; you can’t even call Amazon customer service to make such requests.
I have returned items that were not returnable under policy at JD and Suning before, including milk and diapers. I contacted customer service for returns in all cases, and they refunded me. However, when it comes to Amazon, things are different.
How did you handle it with your customer service?
Tell me either I take it myself or that the delivery person buys it for me; how does it even stand that the delivery person is already difficult enough to begin with? How dare I have him pay to buy something not his own purchase!
Okay, I won't back out either; I'll take it myself and give you one star for your service.
Amazon’s own products should not be selling such items.
Buy during sales prices for better deals; the reviews also indicate that it is a good product.
When I received the products, it left me astounded; the surface of the item was heavily scratched, and there were multiple other places that were similarly damaged. These items are either second-hand or old goods, or at least one is likely to be defective (see attachment).
I am applying for a return; the manufacturer's people say it was caused by transportation, is this not nonsense?
How can something be worn out within a product?
There are only two possibilities: either defective or old goods; or I deliberately damaged the product and returned it.
In short, I do not have evidence that proves that I damaged the product; however, based on my credit record of purchasing on Amazon, I believe that such products should not appear in Amazon’s direct sales category. Customers choosing Amazon’s direct sales is trusting us; customer wins, we win – customers’ victory is also the manufacturer’s. Let’s all work together to improve and thank you all for your support.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It is definitely genuine; I have checked it at the boutique and the watch looks very nice in appearance with fine workmanship. The materials used are sufficient, and as it has an imported mechanical movement, it carries some weight. It cannot be compared to those so-called mechanical watches priced around 300 yuan. This is authentic merchandise.
The watch is accurate and the error is well within acceptable limits. There is also a gemological certificate inside the package, and there's true diamond at 12 o'clock on the dial; this watch fits perfectly for yourself as an accessory to be worn or given as a gift with dignity.
Bentley watch is indeed good.
Light and portable large capacity
I like it for its lightness and capacity but I find two separate compartments to be a bit excessive; I'm not sure what to put in them.
After buying it, I found that there was another brand similar one on Overseas Shopping (Meizu) for less than two hundred yuan.
When I bought it for the first time, something was wrong with the product; all of its lights were flashing and not working at all.
We want a refund; it took three days to receive the goods in Shanghai and they have not been delivered.
And he didn't answer when I called to pick him up for delivery.
The courier company says they have that contact information only.
Amazon cannot find a place to lodge a complaint.
I was not asked to do anything, so it's completely unexpected and without cause for me to delay delivery - I got this message saying that the order would be delayed due to my request for an extended delivery window.
